{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "description": "lookAt({ x, y, z, turn_speed_deg_s? })。spec §8.2；turn_speed_deg_s 为 M3.5 v1.2 增强。\n\nturn_speed_deg_s（30..720 度/秒）有值时平滑转头：固定角速度插值到目标朝向\n（yaw/pitch 同速推进、先到的轴等待，误差 <1° 收口精确落位），期间新的 look\n调用会替换目标；缺省 = 瞬间转（v1.0/v1.1 行为，完全向后兼容）。",
  "properties": {
    "x": {
      "title": "X",
      "type": "number"
    },
    "y": {
      "title": "Y",
      "type": "number"
    },
    "z": {
      "title": "Z",
      "type": "number"
    },
    "turn_speed_deg_s": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "maximum": 720.0,
          "minimum": 30.0,
          "type": "number"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Turn Speed Deg S"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "x",
    "y",
    "z"
  ],
  "title": "LookAtParams",
  "type": "object"
}
